<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec refined copper output rises yr/yr--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec refined copper output rises yr/yr--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refined copper output in December rose from the same month last year, according to Ministry of International Trade and Industry data released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The MITI data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Dec 96   yr/yr change   Nov 96</p>
<p> Output	  107,774	+3.9	 103,271</p>
<p> Shipments     107,843	+7.4	 110,403</p>
<p> Stocks	   47,452	+7.5	  43,944</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
